      "text": "Work item entered in ODT/FEDIT:\nAdd the Employee Finder section to the home page with search and department filtering and fix the linked defect where the Submit Request button is enabled even when mandatory fields are incomplete.\nODT planning:\nODT hardens the story and defect into clear execution-ready workpacks, identifies impacted files across the finder UI, form component, validation utilities, and test assets, and prepares review-ready design, code, unit-test, and accessibility guidance.\nReviewer checkpoint:\nA reviewer adds a note that the defect fix must not only disable the button initially but also re-disable it when a required field becomes empty or invalid, while preserving keyboard and screen-reader behavior.\nGoverned execution:\nThe approved execution path is delegated to OCA-backed Codex or Cline; OCI GenAI can enrich stage prompts, while fallback prompts and reviewer overrides remain available for resilience and control.\nHuman approval:\nThe returned diff is reviewed for filter behavior, validation correctness, test alignment, user-facing consistency, and accessibility expectations before the change is accepted or sent back for refinement.\n\n",
